# Local secrets and runtime state must never enter the build context
# (2026-11-02 review P1-1): the build stage does `COPY . .`, so anything
# not excluded here lands in intermediate image layers and the local build
# cache. `.env.example` stays — it is the documented template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.jwt-secret
.encryption-key*
agent-world.config.json
artifacts/
logs/
backups/
handoff.md
